    <div class="grid" id="grid"></div>
    <div class="beat-marks" id="beatMarks"></div>
  </div>
  <details>
    <summary>Built from your answers</summary>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Web app (Q1):</strong> Entire app runs in-browser using Web Audio API — no install needed.</li>
      <li><strong>Step sequencer grid (Q2):</strong> Classic 4×16 drum-machine-style clickable grid to toggle beats on/off.</li>
      <li><strong>Built-in synthesized sounds (Q3):</strong> Kick, Snare, Hi-Hat &amp; Melodic voices generated purely via Web Audio oscillators and noise — no external files.</li>
      <li><strong>Waveform / oscilloscope (Q4):</strong> Real-time canvas waveform visualization connected through an AnalyserNode.</li>
      <li><strong>4 tracks (Q5):</strong> Exactly 4 instrument rows in the sequencer grid.</li>
      <li><strong>Session only, no saving (Q6):</strong> No save, load, or export buttons exist; all pattern data is lost on page refresh.</li>
    </ul>
  </details>
